<title>NETHERLANDS: Labouchere raises Oce price target.</title>
<headline>Labouchere raises Oce price target.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Feb 18 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Oce	   Office equipment  239.50  Bank Labouchere</p>
<p>COMMENT: Q4 figures were in line with our expectations but substantially above mean of market estimates. PE premium to other growth stocks not high, leaves room for outperformance. We increase 12 month price target to 300 guilders from 250.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)	9.06    (xx.xx)   20.7     3.00</p>
<p>    1997		  11.33		  21.1     3.75</p>
<p>    1998		  14.06		  17.0     4.75</p>
